{"type":"plan","title":"雪の狐火","logline":"一尾の狐が、迷子の子を尻尾の灯で導く一夜。","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Snowy forest at deep dusk. Vast empty paper space. Tiny fox silhouette on a low ridge, tail curled. Far below, a scatter of warm village lights glimmers like ink dots. Snow specks drift down.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"毎晩、狐は村の灯を数えていた。"},{"index":2,"shotType":"Slow zoom-in","description":"Closer on the fox. Dark ink silhouette fills lower third. Tail tip begins to bloom — two amber brush-strokes trembling. The glow pushes back the surrounding white. Snowflakes catch light for a frame.","mode":"motion","dialogue":null},{"index":3,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Same forest ridge, later night. Child silhouette huddled at tree base, hood drawn tight. Fox enters from left, tail-flame a moving lantern. Child's head lifts. Negative space dominates.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"「道、知らない……」"},{"index":4,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Fox pauses beside child. Tail curves down, flame brushing child's mitten. Child's loose mitten lifts, caught by warm updraft. Ink lines minimal — only the connection matters.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"「ついておいで」"},{"index":5,"shotType":"Pan","description":"Slow left-to-right pan. Fox leads, child follows. Tail-flame paints a moving pool of amber on trunks and snow. Each step leaves a fleeting warm footprint. Forest depth suggested by fading verticals.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"尻尾の火が、二人分の道になった。"},{"index":6,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Village gate at golden dawn. Paper tone warmed to pale gold. Gate posts stand in dark ink. Lanterns unlit. On the threshold: one aburaage on bamboo leaf. Fox silhouette watches from forest edge, tail unlit.","mode":"still","dialogue":null},{"index":7,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Aburaage fills frame. Bubbled gold surface, one corner folded. Thin ink shadow stretches toward fox. A single snowflake lands on the oil-glisten and holds.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"朝、門前に油揚げひとつ。"}]}
